  "releaseNotes": "Let the installer carry the shared build stamp\nBring the debug branch into master\nBring in the debug branch: the cross-platform UI work and the move onto async persistence\nMerge origin/master into broker-web-designer\nTake in the Avalonia branch, and leave the WPF side out of it\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into broker-web-designer\nMerge origin/master into debug\nRemove redundant project references and GUIDs\nReconcile debug history with origin/master\nFollow the web-api client through its new optional parameters\nUnify the desktop applications onto shared view models\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into debug\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into debug\nClear remaining obsolete-API warnings (NugetRepoProvider logger + Runner Strategy async)\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into broker-web-designer\nDesktop apps: Installer/Server test coverage and a CLS-compliance pass over the shared assemblies\nUse Ecng Common extensions across codebase\nReplace lock statement with Lock.EnterScope() (Ecng polyfill) across codebase\nReplace lock statements with Lock + using + EnterScope in Installer\nFix Installer build: restore ProductUpdate? in Product.cs, suppress CLS warnings\nRemove nullable reference type annotations (CS8632)\nDateTimeOffset -> DateTime UTC\nUpdated Ecng.Nuget to 1.0.327.",
